# Static-host header contract for the docs.
#
# The playground embeds a cross-origin iframe. An iframe is cross-origin
# isolated only when every ancestor is, and isolated is what lets the
# workspace run vent's Rolldown build (and therefore `vent.config.ts` plugins,
# which generate the Spin stylesheet). Cloudflare Pages and Netlify read this
# file; a host that does not must set these headers itself.
#
# `require-corp` rather than `credentialless`: Safari never implemented
# `credentialless`, and an unknown COEP value leaves the page unisolated, so
# every embed beneath it refuses to boot. `/jibe/*` is imported by the embed by
# URL, so it needs CORS.

/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin

/jibe/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
